              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Vaulo, ekalile mĩthenya mingĩ ĩtina wa ũndũ ũsu, ataanĩsya na ana‐a‐asa na athi na ngalawa Silia, na Vilisila na Akwila mathi vamwe nake: eenzewe mũtwe wake ku Kengelea; nĩkwĩthĩwa aĩ na wĩvĩto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mavika Eveso, amatia kw’o: ĩndĩ we mwene alika ĩsinakokenĩ, na asũanĩa na Ayuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mamwĩa ekale ĩvinda ĩasanga, nake ndaaĩtĩkĩla; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
