              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake enda kũinga kũthi Akaia, ala ana‐a‐asa mamũkũmbaĩthya, na mamaandĩkĩa ala amanyiw’a kana mamwose: na avika amatethya mũno ala meetĩkĩlĩte nũndũ wa mumo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.18.27",
